      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 16 · AI Meeting Notes Assistant\nTurns a meeting transcript into a summary, decisions and owner-assigned action items, then shares them on Slack and email.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/meeting-notes` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Gmail OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"meeting_title\": \"Q4 Planning\",\n \"attendees_emails\": \"a@yourco.com,b@yourco.com\",\n \"transcript\": \"Asha: we ship v2 on Dec 10. Ravi: I will finish the billing migration by Dec 1...\"\n}\n```"
      }
    }
